ons have since been displaced  a current humanitarian crisis not seen  in ethiopia  since the 1980s the head of usaid  uh samantha powers is heading over in  fact today  what can she do i think her visitors  sends a very powerful signal that  these atrocities can no longer be  ignored  adams says the 100 thousand children  that the u.n warrens are facing threat  of starvation  should be a hundred thousand reasons for  all sides  to end this conflict right now
 

